        <ul class="rm-index-subs">
          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-2-core-concepts/data-warehousing/#warehouse-fundamentals--architecture">Warehouse Fundamentals</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">As the term suggests, a real-time data warehouse is a system, which reflects all changes to its sources in real time.</span></li>
          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-2-core-concepts/data-warehousing/#warehouse-fundamentals--architecture">Dimensions</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">What is Data Warehousing Hierarchy?</span></li>
        </ul>
      </li>
