        <p class="rm-index-desc">17 interview questions covering Schema Design, Star Schema, Surrogate Keys, SCD.</p>
        <ul class="rm-index-subs">
          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-2-core-concepts/data-warehousing/#star-snowflake-scd--surrogate-keys">Schema Design</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">Version dimension is the SCD type II in real time it using because of it will maintain the current data and full historical data.</span></li>
