          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-2-core-concepts/data-warehousing/#etl-elt--data-integration">Transformations</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">Normalizer: It is a transformation mainly using for cobol sources, it's change the rows into columns and columns into rows Normalization:To remove the redundancy and inconsistency.</span></li>
