          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-2-core-concepts/data-warehousing/#data-modeling-conceptual-logical--physical">ER Modeling</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">What is difference between Er Modeling and Dimensional Modeling? What is Er Diagram?</span></li>
        </ul>
      </li>
      <li class="rm-index-group">
        <h3 class="rm-index-heading"><a href="/level-2-core-concepts/data-warehousing/#normalization--relational-theory">Normalization &amp; Relational Theory</a></h3>
