          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-2-core-concepts/data-warehousing/#database-objects-tables-views--storage">Relational Model</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">Each database logically divided into one or more table spaces one or more data files are explicitly created for each table space.</span></li>
