        </ul>
      </li>
      <li class="rm-index-group">
        <h3 class="rm-index-heading"><a href="/level-2-core-concepts/data-warehousing/#transactions--dbms-internals">Transactions &amp; DBMS Internals</a></h3>
        <p class="rm-index-desc">26 interview questions covering Transactions, Views, DBMS Internals.</p>
        <ul class="rm-index-subs">
          <li><span class="rm-index-sub-label"><a href="/level-2-core-concepts/data-warehousing/#transactions--dbms-internals">Transactions</a></span> <span class="rm-index-sub-desc">Data independence means that “the application is independent of the storage structure and access strategy of data”.</span></li>
